07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yhwyVZC8evgQ7kNvwF2T34m&_nc_oc=AdpecZpOOMWwzNb7md-TMYpthQQd85FNoqe4SSXibFx4CJ5qHYy16A5OZfHsXAzPhPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNvkPZTwDfff-V6RGCjMHwLxL3YUc89V0jkzY9mCHKyfA&oe=6AC7A642"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0e-7JaSGnqoQ7kNvwHJzxxX&_nc_oc=AdpZcRHrpuOodICuJbA3svTAf7aDnZxD6sEFHSsmfRqpqnXeAf9IINbZ9kKnAX1ZtAI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNEFyKKtduMg4PueNnBd2bAyHgOniGxh81mHUPNZc6kjQ&oe=6AC79BBF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=svBfcL2PsEcQ7kNvwEQnWo0&_nc_oc=Adp4clvmWrOMS2xAe1EUwmAmwkZdb1mKhbzCAdhxoUGz7aiFcyjZyMCzcode_RQfqY0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM0oKXx-MODk48_ZoTU3Bv1dusKDmFPewInDKgX-Koasg&oe=6AC7AAB0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic